category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Implementation of I/O readiness notification facilities (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libivykis is a thin wrapper over various OS'es implementation of I/O readiness
notification facilities (such as poll(2), kqueue(2)) and is mainly intended
for writing portable high-performance network servers."
